        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"title\": \"\ud83d\udea8 Workflow Error: {{ $('Log Error').first().json.workflow }} - {{ $('Log Error').first().json.node }}\",\n  \"body\": \"## Automated Error Report\\n\\n**Workflow:** {{ $('Log Error').first().json.workflow }}\\n**Workflow ID:** {{ $('Log Error').first().json.workflow_id }}\\n**Failed Node:** {{ $('Log Error').first().json.node }}\\n**Timestamp:** {{ $('Log Error').first().json.timestamp }}\\n**Execution ID:** {{ $('Log Error').first().json.execution_id }}\\n\\n### Error Message\\n\\n```\\n{{ $('Log Error').first().json.message }}\\n```\\n\\n### Task Context\\n\\n{{ $('Log Error').first().json.task_id ? 'Task ID: ' + $('Log Error').first().json.task_id : 'No task context available' }}\\n\\n---\\n*This issue was automatically created by the Error Handler workflow.*\",\n  \"labels\": [\"bug\", \"automated\", \"workflow-error\"]\n}",
